          "beats": 2.0,
          "lyric": "Lord"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "verse_number": 3,
      "lyrics_text": "The Lord is close to the brokenhearted; those whose spirit is crushed he will save. The Lord ransoms the souls of his servants, those who hide in him shall not be condemned.",
